Hi Mark,
I can now confirm that the before mentioned fix to part 4 makes all output data of GGIR consistent with version 1.9-1.
While investigating this I also found one extra minor inconsistency in variable 1to6am_ENMO as stored in part2_summary.csv. I have addressed this and pushed all changed to the master branch on GitHub and numbered it as version 1.10-3. In the upcoming days I will upload this to CRAN.

In case anyone wants to replicate my comparison between GGIR package versions, please find attached the R script I just wrote to make the comparison.
All you have to do is process the data with two difference GGIR versions and point the path9 and path10 objects in this script to the respective output folders.
Best wishes,
Vincent

