Hi Thomas,

For Part2 you set mvpathreshold. Part2 provides results with no differentiation between sleep / wake.

For Part5 you set threshold.lig / threshold.mod / threshold.vig and their respective bout criteria as well. Part5 differentiates between sleep / wake and differentiates between moderate and vigorous physical activity. It sounds like you are interested in using Part5 outputs.

Cheers, Matt

